Requires a Python environment with faiss installed.

Usage:
python3.9 index_file_tool.py show xxx(file_path)
python3.9 index_file_tool.py search xxx(file_path) xxx(vector)

Examples:
# Parse an IVFPQ index file
python3.9 index_file_tool.py show ivfpq.index

# Run example to generate an HNSW index file
cd ~/tenann/build_Release/examples && ./faiss_hnsw_example
# Parse an HNSW index file
python3.9 index_file_tool.py show /tmp/faiss_hnsw_index
python3.9 index_file_tool.py show /tmp/faiss_hnsw_index1
python3.9 index_file_tool.py show /tmp/faiss_hnsw_index2
